05:37.520 --> 05:44.240
to improve collaboration in the NHS specifically by removing the 2012 act provisions that increased the

05:44.240 --> 05:50.720
role of the competition and mergers authority in core NHS business such as trust mergers whilst keeping

05:50.720 --> 05:58.000
their vital work in tackling abuses in markets such as generic medicine pricing remove the 2012 act duty

05:58.000 --> 06:03.600
and powers for monitor to act as a competition authority so the NHS improvement can focus on

06:03.600 --> 06:12.000
improvement scrap section 75 of the 2012 act which gave monitor enforcement duties over commissioners

06:12.000 --> 06:18.480
including to set aside procurements as well as enshrining rigid and costly procurement requirements

06:19.680 --> 06:25.360
requirements which are also inconsistent with the separate public procurement regulations

06:25.360 --> 06:33.280
regulations we're proposing to remove the NHS from the public contract regulations so that the NHS

06:33.280 --> 06:39.760
